AccountLogin_TitleText=LOGIN TO EA ACCOUNT
AccountLogin_DescriptionText=To use online functions you need an EA account. Click CREATE ACCOUNT to create a new account.\n\nDo you have an EA account already? Enter your e-mail address and password to login.
CreateAccount_TitleText=CREATE EA ACCOUNT
CreateAccount_DescriptionText=To create an EA Account you can use the e-mail and password below, or change the info if you like.\n\nIf you already have an EA account you can enter that information.\n\nYou’ll need to remember this e-mail and password to access game-specific content on EA web sites.
