[TdTutorialMessages]
Welcome=Welcome to the Mirror's Edge training area - here you will learn the basics of playing
ButtonTestJump=<StringAliasBindings:GBA_Jump> is for upwards movement such as jumping. Try to jump
ButtonTestCrouch=<StringAliasBindings:GBA_Crouch> is for downwards movement such as crouching. Try to crouch
ButtonTestObj=<StringAliasBindings:GBA_InGameMenu> will open the objectives screen, containing your training challenges. Open the objectives screen
Welcome2=Momentum is very important in Mirror's Edge. You build momentum by running and by performing certain moves. It affects almost all of your actions in some way - for example how far you jump and slide
LOI=Your Runner Vision will pick out interesting objects in the environment and color them red. Follow the red objects

FirstJump=<StringAliasBindings:GBA_Jump> to jump over the gap ahead
Slide=<StringAliasBindings:GBA_Crouch> (hold) while running to slide under the red vent
LookAt=<StringAliasBindings:GBA_LookAt> (hold) will look at your goal. Celeste is calling you over; get to her
AfterSpeedVault=Follow Celeste

VaultOver=<StringAliasBindings:GBA_Jump> to vault over fences
Wallrun=<StringAliasBindings:GBA_Jump> while running towards a wall to wallrun
SpeedVault=<StringAliasBindings:GBA_Jump> when close to low obstacles performs a speed vault. This move builds momentum
Barge=<StringAliasBindings:GBA_Fire> gets you through red doors

Balance=%SixAxis_BalanceWalk%<StringAliasBindings:GBA_StrafeLeft><StringAliasBindings:GBA_StrafeRight><StringAliasBindings:GBA_Strafe> to keep your balance on the beam
WallClimb=<StringAliasBindings:GBA_Jump> to scale walls (wallclimb)

Swing=<StringAliasBindings:GBA_Jump> to jump to the red crossbar, automatically grab it and start swinging
SwingHint=<StringAliasBindings:GBA_Jump> to jump from the swing to the red pipe ahead. Use <StringAliasBindings:GBA_MoveForward><StringAliasBindings:GBA_StrafeLeft><StringAliasBindings:GBA_StrafeRight><StringAliasBindings:GBA_Backward><StringAliasBindings:GBA_Strafe> to control your movement on the swing and <StringAliasBindings:GBA_LookBehind> to turn around
ClimbOne=<StringAliasBindings:GBA_TurnLeft><StringAliasBindings:GBA_TurnRight><StringAliasBindings:GBA_LookUp><StringAliasBindings:GBA_LookDown><StringAliasBindings:GBA_Look_Gamepad><StringAliasBindings:GBA_Look_MouseX><StringAliasBindings:GBA_Look_MouseY> to look around while on the pipe. Look at the pipe to the left and use <StringAliasBindings:GBA_Jump> to jump
ClimbTwo=<StringAliasBindings:GBA_StrafeLeft><StringAliasBindings:GBA_StrafeRight><StringAliasBindings:GBA_Strafe> in combination with <StringAliasBindings:GBA_Jump> can also be used to jump left and right between pipes
Shimmy=<StringAliasBindings:GBA_Jump> to wallclimb to the ledge above
PreShimmy=<StringAliasBindings:GBA_StrafeLeft><StringAliasBindings:GBA_StrafeRight><StringAliasBindings:GBA_Strafe> (hold) to shimmy left or right. The fence here prevents you from getting up. Look around the corner to the left for a way up
ClimbUp=<StringAliasBindings:GBA_Jump> to get up

VJumpGrab=<StringAliasBindings:GBA_Jump>, <StringAliasBindings:GBA_LookBehind>, <StringAliasBindings:GBA_Jump> as three quick presses will get you up here. Wallrun, turn, jump is a very useful combination of moves
JumpToGrab=<StringAliasBindings:GBA_Jump> to wallclimb to the rooftop above
LedgeWalk=<StringAliasBindings:GBA_StrafeLeft><StringAliasBindings:GBA_StrafeRight><StringAliasBindings:GBA_Strafe> will control your movement when walking a ledge. Carefully walk out on the ledge ahead

ZipLine=<StringAliasBindings:GBA_Jump> to jump to the zipline and automatically grab it
SoftLanding=<StringAliasBindings:GBA_Crouch> to dismount from things like this zipline. Try to land on the soft red object below - it will break your fall

CoilJump=<StringAliasBindings:GBA_Crouch> (hold) to coil up and make yourself smaller in the air. Jump (<StringAliasBindings:GBA_Jump>) and coil over the barbed wire ahead
RollLanding=%SixAxis_SkillRoll%<StringAliasBindings:GBA_Crouch> (hold) to skill roll when close to the ground after a high fall. This will smoothen out the landing
SpringBoard=<StringAliasBindings:GBA_Jump> to use objects stacked like this as springboards for high jumps. Aim for the ladder ahead and springboard up to it
FinalJump=<StringAliasBindings:GBA_Jump> to jump up to the rooftop ahead

MeleeAttack=<StringAliasBindings:GBA_Fire> to punch. This is your basic attack. Try to hit Celeste's hands
LowMeleeAttack=<StringAliasBindings:GBA_Crouch> (hold), <StringAliasBindings:GBA_Fire> to do a low punch
JumpKickAttack=<StringAliasBindings:GBA_Jump>, <StringAliasBindings:GBA_Fire> to jump kick. Damage from this attack depends on your momentum
SlideKickAttack=<StringAliasBindings:GBA_Crouch> (hold), <StringAliasBindings:GBA_Fire> while running to slide kick. Slide kicks are effective for ducking under hostile attacks and connecting with a powerful stun

RearDisarm=%SixAxis_Disarm%<StringAliasBindings:GBA_SwitchWeapon> to disarm hostiles from the back
DiscardWeapon=<StringAliasBindings:GBA_SwitchWeapon> will also drop or pick up a weapon. To fire, use <StringAliasBindings:GBA_Fire> - but don't hit Celeste! Drop the weapon
FrontDisarm=%SixAxis_Disarm%<StringAliasBindings:GBA_SwitchWeapon> to perform a frontal disarm when the weapon turns red. Timing is very important

Interact=<StringAliasBindings:GBA_Use> to interact with objects such as buttons and valves. Open the door
RunnerSense=When you see that flash of red - you are feeling pressured to have to fight or to find another solution past enemies
Combo=<StringAliasBindings:GBA_Jump>, <StringAliasBindings:GBA_Fire>, <StringAliasBindings:GBA_Fire>, <StringAliasBindings:GBA_Fire> to perform a powerful combination: jump kick, punch, punch
RTDisarm=<StringAliasBindings:GBA_ReactionTime> enters slow motion when Reaction time is available (blue reticle). This makes it easy to disarm hostiles. Running generates Reaction Time
OrAfterSixAxisIcon=or

