[TdTransition]
LoadingText=LOADING
LoadingLevelText=LOADING CHAPTER
LoadingMenuText=LOADING MAIN MENU
HintText=Hint:
SPHint_NumberOf=6
SPHint_0=HINT: Don't try to take on groups of hostiles. The key to successful combat is to isolate your enemies and pick them off one at a time.
SPHint_1=HINT: Pick your disarm opportunities carefully. It can be dangerous when other enemies have you in their sights.
SPHint_2=HINT: Melee attacks such as flying kick and slide attack are more powerful than regular punches.
SPHint_3=HINT: Wallrun kick will spin the enemy 180 degrees making for an easy disarm.
SPHint_4=HINT: Remember to always look for alternative routes that may be faster or give you an advantage over enemies.
SPHint_5=HINT: Runner bags and stash points can be found throughout the world if you look carefully enough.
SPHint_6=HINT: Only tackle opponents that are highlighted by Runner Vision - all others you should run from.
TTHint_NumberOf=9
TTHint_0=HINT: Look for alternative routes that may win you a second or two.
TTHint_1=HINT: Clear high obstacles and jump longer by coil jumping.
TTHint_2=HINT: Download and study other players' ghosts in the leaderboard to learn new routes.
TTHint_3=HINT: Beat qualifying times to receive stars and increase your skill rating.
TTHint_4=HINT: A ghost will only be stored if you beat your personal best and a qualifying time.
TTHint_5=HINT: Compare your skill rating in the leaderboard and race against any time and ghost.
TTHint_6=HINT: Playing offline will not affect your online stats.
TTHint_7=HINT: Beat a three-star qualifying time by completing a flawless run using the best possible route.
TTHint_8=HINT: Speed vault over fences and other obstacles by timing the jump correctly.



